   "title": {
    "zh": "先试探，再回退",
    "en": "Try, Then Roll Back"
   },
   "why": {
    "zh": "五个朋友分住两间屋，两张床和三张床，只许一换一。每个人的 D 值、一对的收益、省下 9 的交换、亏 8 的试探、回退到最佳前缀；人更多时亏一步可能打开一扇门；最后空前缀让一切停下。",
    "en": "Five friends in two rooms, two beds and three, allowed only one-for-one swaps. Each person's D value, a pair's gain, a swap that saves 9, a trial that loses 8, the roll-back to the best prefix; with more people one loss can open a door; and the empty prefix that ends it."
   },
