       "text": "This chapter's seed is AE | BCD, cut 12.",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 13.667,
       "end": 19.133,
       "text": "The only move: swap one from each side; the side sizes stay.",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 19.533,
       "end": 23.533,
       "text": "First, each node's external and internal weight.",
       "sceneId": "k02-dvalues"
      },
      {
       "start": 23.533,
       "end": 28.333,
       "text": "D = external − internal: A is +6, C is −4.",
       "sceneId": "k02-dvalues"
      },
      {
       "start": 28.333,
       "end": 33.356,
       "text": "D is how much the cut drops if that node alone moves.",
       "sceneId": "k02-dvalues"
      },
      {
       "start": 33.756,
       "end": 38.778,
       "text": "A pair swap's gain: the two D values added, minus 2w.",
       "sceneId": "k03-gain"
      },
      {
       "start": 38.778,
       "end": 45.8,
       "text": "Both D values count E–D as external, and it stays cut after the swap, so it comes off twice.",
       "sceneId": "k03-gain"
      },
      {
       "start": 45.8,
       "end": 51.489,
       "text": "Of the six candidates A↔D is largest, +9; E↔D is −1.",
       "sceneId": "k03-gain"
      },
      {
       "start": 51.889,
       "end": 57.133,
       "text": "One pass: pick the largest-gain pair, swap, lock, recompute D.",
       "sceneId": "k04-pass"
      },
      {
       "start": 57.133,
       "end": 61.267,
       "text": "Step 1, A↔D: cut 12 → 3.",
       "sceneId": "k04-pass"
      },
      {
       "start": 61.267,
       "end": 67.844,
       "text": "At step 2 every gain is negative; take E↔C anyway: the cut rises to 11.",
       "sceneId": "k04-pass"
      },
      {
       "start": 67.844,
       "end": 72.2,
       "text": "No movable node is left on the left; the trials end.",
       "sceneId": "k04-pass"
      },
      {
       "start": 72.6,
       "end": 76.289,
       "text": "Cumulative gains: 0, +9, +1.",
       "sceneId": "k05-prefix"
      },
